Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Hold the queue's drop until its reorder returns

The queue screens kept a dropped order until a later read drew the moved
row in its slot, or the lane changed length. Both apps now keep the
dropped order until the reorder returns, then draw the lane's rows, which
show what is stored whether the move took or not.

