Subject: [PATCH 05/10] Take the Storage menu's target by its clicked position

The Storage Manager's menu found the clicked release by searching the
loaded rows for its id, and stopped the app when the search missed. It
now takes the row the table draws at the clicked position. Core's
selection answer also says whether the list holds any of the selected
releases, so the menu no longer tests the answer's rows for emptiness.

