From f08b3db7531339e294b2751dfda50b6abc6567c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:41:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Move the preload reorder tests' entry in the context
 lane

Playing a track leaves both queued tracks in the context lane, so the
reorder these tests send must name that lane; naming the manual one
moved nothing.

