From 0f58e071471c02db9091ab77f5033d651263f8b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:07:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Number playlist entries in the playlist's query

The Mac playlist page numbered each entry from its place among the rows
it had loaded. The entries query now counts each entry's number with
ROW_NUMBER over the same window that orders them, and the row and the
dragged copy draw that number.

